      "m_displayImage1": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Khrulhu_Scientist_C_NPC.dds",
      "m_displayImage2": "",
      "m_clientTags": [],
      "m_genericEvents": [],
      "m_autoQualify": false,
      "m_autoComplete": false,
      "m_dialogList": {
        "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
        "m_dialogs": [
          {
            "m_dialogTag": "Completion",
            "m_dialogEntries": [
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-YELLOW-NPC05-A_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Creative energy can indeed infest the mind with fear and turn that fear into power.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Khrulhu_Scientist_C_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Balaur_AH-YELLOW_054.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752287,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-YELLOW-NPC05-A_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "What other feelings or instincts could that work with, I wonder? Hatred? Despair? Joy? What kind of power could they create?",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Khrulhu_Scientist_C_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Balaur_AH-YELLOW_055.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752287,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-YELLOW-NPC05-A_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "But I get ahead of myself. The infectious Akasha works, but it still needs a delivery vector. A weapon, a monster, a spell, something.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Khrulhu_Scientist_C_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Balaur_AH-YELLOW_056.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752287,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-YELLOW-NPC05-A_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "I must go inform the High Lapona at once!",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Khrulhu_Scientist_C_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Balaur_AH-YELLOW_057.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752287,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-YELLOW-NPC05-A_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "That was... unsettling. And it did not tell us what Miranda Briar is after, only how it works. She seeks a vector to infest minds?",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_StormTrainerF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Ione_Virga_AH-YELLOW_125.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752265,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-YELLOW-NPC05-A_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Presuming that's the end and not the means to it. Perhaps she has Tritons of her own to eliminate.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Qismah_Shasa_AH-YELLOW_119.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752368,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-YELLOW-NPC05-A_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "In either event, I expect we have learned all we can from this era. Who is to say how many years it will take them to develop that vector?",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_StormTrainerF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Ione_Virga_AH-YELLOW_126.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752265,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-YELLOW-NPC05-A_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Agreed. Let us return to reality for now.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Qismah_Shasa_AH-YELLOW_120.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752368,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
